{"records":[{"findings":[{"actual_failure":"Six parametrized cases that ran and gated pull requests inside gate-main before the move (the projected-variant half of test_entry_point_imports_under_user_scope_layout, which verifies build-projected skill entry points import cleanly under user-scope layout) now silently skip on every pull request after the move \u2014 a check weakened by the move, violating the spec's Never do, its Contract ('no check is added, removed, or weakened'), and its Outcome ('Every check that gated a pull request before the move still runs'). The invocation set is preserved byte-identical, so the loss is invisible to the posture test, the parity lint, and the aggregator.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["AC-0001","AC-0008"],"evidence_refs":["docs/specs/ci-gate-main-carve-out-sibling/notes/verification-ledger.md:85-88",".github/workflows/build-check.yml:1681",".github/workflows/build-check.yml:1664-1679",".github/workflows/build-check.yml:237","tests/roster/test_credential_user_scope_invocation.py:174-182","tools/repo/build_gate_chain.py:236-238","Makefile:161-166","packages/agentbundle/agentbundle/build/recipes/per-pack-apm-package.toml:6-7","packages/agentbundle/agentbundle/build/main.py:524-543",".gitignore:100"],"finding_id":"R1-001","material":true,"observation":"The sibling job runs 'python -m pytest tests/ -q' in shard-1 with no build step, and dist/ is gitignored (.gitignore:100), so its fresh checkout never has dist/apm/. tests/roster/test_credential_user_scope_invocation.py skips all six 'projected'-variant cases when dist/apm/ is absent (pytest.skip, exit 0, silent under -q). Before the move, gate-main's 'Run make build-check' (base 6dc12944e build-check.yml:231) ran before the carve-out step (base :1085), and make build-check materializes dist/apm/: Makefile:161-166 chains tools/repo/build_gate_chain.py build-check --output-dir dist, whose catalogue-build leg (build_gate_chain.py:236-238) runs 'agentbundle catalogue build --root . --output dist', and the default recipe set (packages/agentbundle/agentbundle/build/main.py:524-543) includes per-pack-apm-package (route apm, output-subdir apm). The ledger excludes dist/apm/ from the probe on the claim 'gate-main does not run make build-self, so the suite skips there today for the same reason' \u2014 false: make build-check's catalogue-build leg, not make build-self, is what supplied dist/apm/ inside gate-main.","reachable_path":"PR evaluates build-check.yml -> gate-catalogue-tests shard-1 -> dispatch step 'pytest tests/' -> tests/roster/test_credential_user_scope_invocation.py collected -> projected variant sees DIST_APM absent -> pytest.skip x6 -> shard exits green -> aggregator reports success. No gate reddens: the posture test pins the dispatch body's text (not skip outcomes) and the probe (build-check.yml:1664) deliberately does not check dist/apm/.","rule_ref":"spec ci-gate-main-carve-out-sibling Agent Rules / Never do ('Drop, skip, weaken, or narrow any check to save time') and Contract ('no check is added, removed, or weakened')","schema_version":1},{"actual_failure":"The durable AC-0001 evidence record cites non-branch-reachable input revisions and mislabels one, undermining the provenance ('Each entry names its method, its input revisions, and its result') the ledger exists to provide.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["AC-0001"],"evidence_refs":["docs/specs/ci-gate-main-carve-out-sibling/notes/verification-ledger.md:18-19"],"finding_id":"R1-005","material":true,"observation":"The ledger names its comparison inputs as before = 5499ff9d9 ('the spec-approval state, pre-carve-out') and after = 'the T1 commit a0ac3a36d working tree'. Neither commit is an ancestor of HEAD: 5499ff9d9 is a dangling 'docs(knowledge): capture gate-mechanism and pin-ordering patterns from ci-gate-main-carve-out-sibling authoring' commit (not a spec-approval state), and the T1 commit delivered in the branch is 3c690bcc6, not a0ac3a36d. build-check.yml is byte-identical between 5499ff9d9 and the review base 6dc12944e, so the recorded comparison's substance holds \u2014 but both cited revisions are unreachable from any branch and will not survive garbage collection.","reachable_path":"A future auditor re-running the ledger's AC-0001 proof at its named input revisions finds objects no branch retains (and that git gc prunes); the 'spec-approval state' description of the before-revision is false.","rule_ref":"plan ci-gate-main-carve-out-sibling T2 ('before-listing (from the base commit's workflow)') and the ledger's own input-revision record","schema_version":1}],"lineage":{"producer":"agent-ready-reviewer/adversarial-reviewer (company/glm-5-3)","review_policy_fingerprint":"review-policy-sha256:58db0b3763d5ea970e9e2c61b589cb889a33ad1d0a0f47875cceda9f74334f8e","sequence":1,"source_event_id":"review:adversarial-reviewer:0cac18b3ce5294d282245441:1"},"report_id":"review-report-run-3a659195cba798ec-adversarial-r1","role":"adversarial-reviewer","schema_version":1,"subject":{"delivery_subject_ref":{"acceptance_fingerprint":"370da875ea7f4d6fbfb37d3cac4817ceaf267365960869fb99442229ffc6d754","subject_id":"run-3a659195cba798ec"},"lineage":{"projection_version":"1.0","provider":"core-review-subject-projector"},"normalized_paths":[".github/workflows/build-check.yml",".github/workflows/test-corpus.yml","docs/architecture/verification-graph.md","tools/fixtures/build-check-good.yml","tools/lint-ci-parity.py","tools/test-build-check-workflow.py","tools/test-lint-ci-parity.py","uv.lock"],"normalized_statuses":["modified","modified","modified","modified","modified","modified","modified","added"],"review_policy_fingerprint":"review-policy-sha256:58db0b3763d5ea970e9e2c61b589cb889a33ad1d0a0f47875cceda9f74334f8e","review_subject_fingerprint":"review-subject-sha256:35731ded7bdbd9161098766fd9ea6f109615adad0cac18b3ce5294d282245441","review_subject_id":"review-subject-sha256:35731ded7bdbd9161098766fd9ea6f109615adad0cac18b3ce5294d282245441","schema_version":1},"